{title: Iris}
{artist: Goo Goo Dolls}
{key: Bm}
{meta: tuning E A D G B E}

{comment: Chord Voicings}
{define: A base-lookup fret 1 fingers x 0 2 2 2 0}
{define: Bm base-lookup fret 1 fingers x 2 4 4 3 2}
